  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.5.0 adds advanced deterministic interaction control over the published 1.4 router: bounded immutable-parent interaction scopes with LIFO activation, explicit singular pointer capture with signed out-of-bounds targets, deterministic spatial logical focus, clock-free pointer gesture normalization, and bounded scope-level command bindings with region-to-scope-to-global precedence. The release preserves callback-free synchronous routing, application-owned policy, the published 1.4 root/unscoped behavior, and AssemblyVersion 1.0.0.0. Runtime dependencies are Icod.Terminal 1.15.0 and Icod.TermInfo 1.14.0.",
